# MASTER PROMPT: NexusIQ — Enterprise AI Knowledge Platform
## Secure, Multi-Tenant, RAG-Powered Enterprise Knowledge Workspace

Act as a Senior Full-Stack Engineer, AI Engineer, Software Architect, Security Engineer, Database Designer, and UI/UX Designer.

Build a complete, production-oriented web application called **NexusIQ — Enterprise AI Knowledge Platform**.

The application should allow companies to securely upload internal documents, organize knowledge by teams and departments, ask natural-language questions, receive AI-generated answers with verifiable source citations, and manage enterprise knowledge through granular access controls and analytics.

This must be a functional, end-to-end application, not just a landing page or UI prototype.

Every major feature must have a working frontend, backend API, database integration, validation, loading states, error handling, and appropriate security controls.

**Core principle: Security must be enforced before retrieval. Unauthorized document content must never be passed to the LLM, included in prompts, returned through APIs, or exposed through search results.**

